Sumantra announces Rāma waiting at door --- King gathers wives then summons Rāma --- King rushes to Rāma and faints --- Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa seat king on couch --- Rāma seeks leave for Daṇḍaka forest --- King begs Rāma to take kingdom instead --- Rāma refuses and chooses truth over kingdom --- Rāma rejects one-night stay and yields earth to Bharata
